{
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization disproving the Pierce-Birkhoff conjecture as stated in google-deepmind/formal-conjectures (`PierceBirkhoff.pierce_birkhoff_conjecture`). Following Lai, Lim, and Ren (arXiv:2609.10420, 2026), we construct a piecewise-quadratic function on R^30 identified with pairs of symmetric 5x5 real matrices, prove that it admits a finite closed semi-algebraic polynomial cover (`IsPiecewiseMvPolynomial`), and prove directly that it cannot be written as a finite supremum of finite infima of multivariate polynomials.",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "Maxence Faldor"
    }
  ],
